WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Krishnamurti: We will consider your questions this morning.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Question: How can the mind be quiet?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
First we must understand what makes the mind restless.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Thought seeks security in its own images and continues moving.
